WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.950
Hello and welcome. You are a veterinary technician, or a vet tech, at Eagle Valley Animal Hospital.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.950
A vet tech helps the veterinarian examine animals, run lab tests, and explain care to owners.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.950
Today, Ms. Kinzy brought in her dog, Gus.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.950
Gus eats a lot, but he keeps losing weight. Your job today is to find out why.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.950
You’re going to read Gus’s patient chart, then learn two big ideas that will help you understand his problem: metabolism and homeostasis.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.950
Can you help me save my sweet boy Gus?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.950
All right, get into it!
